  "description": "The Pdftools SDK is a comprehensive development library that lets developers integrate advanced PDF conversion, optimization, and validation functionalities into in-house applications.\n\n    PDF software by developers for developers:\n      • Regular feature releases\n      • No external dependencies\n      • Comprehensive manual and code samples\n      • Supports PDF 1.x, PDF 2.0, PDF/A\n\n    Visit our website for more information.",
